{
  "id": {
    "address": "party_media",
    "name": "party_media"
  },
  "doc": " Profile imagery for a party, stored as a single Walrus quilt.\n\n All of a party's images (avatar, header/cover, …) live together in one Walrus\n quilt — batching them under a single storage reservation is markedly cheaper\n than one blob each, which matters when the platform sponsors storage. Only the\n quilt's blob id is held on-chain, as a `Media` dynamic field on the party's\n UID, gated by the `PartyAdminCap`; views are permissionless.\n\n The chain is deliberately role-agnostic: which patch is the avatar vs the\n header is a client convention (quilt patch *identifiers*, e.g. \"avatar\" /\n \"header\"), derived off-chain — never stored here. Updating any image means\n re-storing the quilt and calling `set_media` with the new id.",
  "immediate_dependencies": [
    {
      "address": "miso_party",
      "name": "party"
    },
